proposal = "Rewrite the ABI and frozen-vector sections of docs/site/docs/programs/index.md from current runtime policy, call admission and programs/abi-frozen.sha256. List versions 1-5, import groups and protocol/account-profile restrictions while retaining immutable older definitions."
